1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Lost far from Earth, we searched the stars for a future.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
We found Numens: living frames, shaped by pilots and divine power.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Seek knowledge across a divided galaxy.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Choose four Numens for ground, water, or space.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Take your squad into the unknown.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Use cover. Coordinate abilities. Make every move count.

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Recover Neural Artefacts.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Vast neural archives, holding new possibilities.

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Link one to your Numen.

10
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Unlock equipment, abilities, and a second form.

11
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Expand your carrier. Prepare for what comes next.

12
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Discover your pilots' stories through collectible manga and interactive novels.

13
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Everyone seeks knowledge. Everyone has something to lose.

14
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Your pilots. Your Numens. Your next horizon.
